    {
      "id": "u05-2",
      "title": "Two dogs: plurals",
      "explanation": [
        "Most nouns add **-e** or **-s** for the plural: hond → **honde**, boek → **boeke**, huis → **huise**, vrou → **vroue**; tafel → **tafels**, man → **mans**.",
        "Some double a letter: kat → **katte**.",
        "And some are irregular: kind → **kinders**.",
        "New words: **huis** (house), **boek** (book), **tafel** (table). The dictionary shows every plural."
      ],
      "examples": [
        {
          "af": "Die honde is groot.",
          "en": "The dogs are big."
        },
        {
          "af": "Twee boeke.",
          "en": "Two books."
        },
        {
          "af": "Die kinders is moeg.",
          "en": "The children are tired."
        },
        {
          "af": "Drie katte en twee honde.",
          "en": "Three cats and two dogs."
        }
      ],
      "vocab": [
        "huis",
        "boek",
        "tafel"
      ],
